WEBVTT

01:28.825 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:34.865 --> 01:35.825
Minjia.

01:36.345 --> 01:38.185
Cangcang? What brings you here?

01:38.265 --> 01:40.185
Nothing much is happening in camp,
so I came out to stretch my legs.

01:40.265 --> 01:42.265
Perfect timing.
I was just about to brush the horses.

01:42.345 --> 01:43.385
Come on.

01:44.585 --> 01:45.745
I'll help you.

01:56.305 --> 01:58.865
I can tell,
you still have feelings for him.

01:59.665 --> 02:02.025
If you really didn't care about him,
you wouldn't be so bitter.

02:03.345 --> 02:04.865
You say you're over him,

02:04.945 --> 02:07.665
but you're still hung up
on everything he did.

02:08.505 --> 02:09.465
Honestly,

02:09.985 --> 02:12.425
you love him so deeply,
that's why you hate him so much.

02:13.705 --> 02:15.665
Mr. Bai, you're here too?

02:19.625 --> 02:20.745
What a coincidence.

02:20.825 --> 02:22.425
Are you both here
to help me brush the horses?

02:22.985 --> 02:24.265
Then come on, let's do it together.

02:25.825 --> 02:26.785
Stop hiding.

02:27.305 --> 02:28.185
The more you hide, the more it shows

02:28.265 --> 02:29.625
you still care about him.

03:26.865 --> 03:28.945
Her Highness sent me over
to grab two more brushes.

03:29.025 --> 03:29.905
Understood.

03:34.625 --> 03:36.265
I've long heard General Kumor

03:36.345 --> 03:38.345
is the most respected general in Xijiang.

03:38.945 --> 03:40.105
Now I know the tales are true.

03:40.985 --> 03:41.905
Of course.

03:41.985 --> 03:44.425
Our general is the finest under heaven!

03:44.505 --> 03:46.585
Ever since he joined the army,
he's gone on rounds every night,

03:46.665 --> 03:49.025
rain or shine, never missing a single day.

03:49.665 --> 03:51.945
General Kumor is the pride of Xijiang!

03:54.785 --> 03:55.745
Here you are.

03:56.945 --> 03:57.985
Thanks.

04:03.865 --> 04:06.625
Cangcang, why are you still here?

04:07.145 --> 04:08.025
Didn't Preceptor Du take you away?

04:08.105 --> 04:09.425
Preceptor Du?

04:11.065 --> 04:13.905
She never meat to take me with her.

04:14.505 --> 04:15.625
And wasn't that what you ordered?

04:16.225 --> 04:17.865
She had no intention of taking you?

04:20.345 --> 04:21.425
Cangcang,

04:21.944 --> 04:24.065
in your eyes,
am really I that kind of man?

04:24.145 --> 04:25.465
In my eyes,

04:26.345 --> 04:28.425
you only come to me
when you want something.

04:28.505 --> 04:29.345
That's who you are.

04:29.425 --> 04:33.145
Who knows this time
what you're really after.

04:39.065 --> 04:41.545
-I'll find a way to get you out of here.
-No need.

04:41.625 --> 04:43.145
I have my own reasons for staying.

04:43.665 --> 04:44.945
Don't trouble yourself.

04:45.825 --> 04:47.225
The court is swamped with affairs.

04:47.305 --> 04:48.865
Your Majesty should return soon.

04:59.945 --> 05:01.545
-Let's go.
-Yes, Sir.

05:30.345 --> 05:31.665
-The horses ran off!
-Go after them!

06:27.225 --> 06:28.425
So there was a mechanism.

06:44.945 --> 06:46.025
Cangcang…

06:47.025 --> 06:47.985
As expected.

06:50.985 --> 06:51.825
It's me.

06:53.425 --> 06:54.745
What are you doing here?

06:54.825 --> 06:57.625
If I'm not mistaken,
we're here for the same thing.

06:59.585 --> 07:01.345
There are mechanisms here. I'll handle it.

07:27.425 --> 07:28.785
MILITARY DEPLOYMENT MAP

07:33.505 --> 07:34.585
With war about to break out,

07:34.665 --> 07:36.465
we must tighten our defenses.

07:37.145 --> 07:39.105
If you see anyone suspicious,
report it at once.

07:39.185 --> 07:40.185
Yes, Sir!

07:43.705 --> 07:44.585
Take the map and go.

07:44.665 --> 07:46.025
-I'll go out and draw him away.
-No need!

07:50.825 --> 07:51.785
All units on alert!

07:51.865 --> 07:53.105
-Take some men and come with me!
-Yes, Sir!

08:22.585 --> 08:23.985
That signal arrow just now
must've been fired

08:24.065 --> 08:25.505
from the snowy peak a few miles away.

08:25.585 --> 08:27.225
It must be the signal for a sneak attack.

08:27.305 --> 08:29.385
Ling Jueding just took a spin
outside the city

08:29.465 --> 08:31.265
without making any real move at all.

08:31.345 --> 08:32.625
The enemy is
clearly trying to throw us off.

08:33.144 --> 08:33.985
What are they really up to?

08:37.985 --> 08:38.825
The Military Deployment Map!

09:54.665 --> 09:55.865
If the map is gone,

09:55.945 --> 09:57.425
Kumor will surely lock down
the whole camp.

09:57.505 --> 10:00.785
Then it won't be so easy
to get the map out.

10:03.745 --> 10:05.865
MILITARY DEPLOYMENT MAP

10:41.425 --> 10:44.105
PATROLS; CROSSBOWMEN

11:04.505 --> 11:05.945
I'll find a way to get the map out.

11:07.745 --> 11:09.985
So you really stayed for this.

11:10.745 --> 11:12.225
Do you know how dangerous this is?

11:13.625 --> 11:16.545
-Leave the map to me. I'll get it out.
-No way!

11:16.625 --> 11:18.665
It's already really dangerous
for you here.

11:18.745 --> 11:19.945
We can't risk you getting hurt!

11:21.985 --> 11:23.265
So you are worried about me?

11:27.705 --> 11:29.025
I'm not caring about you.

11:29.105 --> 11:31.425
I just know an empire
can't go a day without its emperor.

11:32.625 --> 11:33.745
Cangcang,

11:34.305 --> 11:36.745
if one day, I'm no longer here,

11:37.345 --> 11:38.265
will you still hate me like this?

11:40.385 --> 11:41.705
Don't jinx it.

11:42.345 --> 11:44.145
Scoundrels live long. You are not dying.

11:45.305 --> 11:46.505
What if I really did?

11:47.025 --> 11:47.865
If…

11:57.345 --> 11:58.785
If you really died,

11:58.865 --> 12:00.585
I wouldn't even visit your grave.

12:05.945 --> 12:08.145
So you'd better stay alive for me.

12:21.545 --> 12:22.745
Let go of me.

12:23.385 --> 12:26.025
I promised
to deliver this map to Ling Jueding.

12:26.625 --> 12:28.785
Once I get
Kumor's Military Deployment Map,

12:28.865 --> 12:30.585
I'll find a way to leave it

12:30.665 --> 12:32.545
in the woods
three li outside the enemy camp.

12:33.145 --> 12:35.545
There's a cluster of three stones.

12:36.065 --> 12:38.545
You can send men there to check every day.

12:40.065 --> 12:41.265
I will not fail Your Majesty's trust.

12:42.065 --> 12:44.505
Once I have the map,
I'll send out the troops at once

12:44.585 --> 12:47.225
and wipe out
Kumor's rebel forces in one strike.

12:47.305 --> 12:48.305
No.

12:48.865 --> 12:49.945
That's not the outcome I want.

12:53.545 --> 12:55.065
Kumor's revolt this time

12:55.145 --> 12:56.985
is entirely because
of the snow disaster in Xijiang.

12:57.505 --> 12:59.305
The people there can hardly survive
and had no choice but to rebel.

13:00.545 --> 13:01.505
Which shows

13:01.585 --> 13:04.625
Kumor is also a lord
speaking up for his people.

13:05.145 --> 13:08.225
So, what you must do

13:08.305 --> 13:10.185
is work with the Xiaoxing Guards

13:10.265 --> 13:12.665
to end this war
with the least possible bloodshed.

13:14.025 --> 13:15.305
I understand, Your Majesty!

13:16.825 --> 13:17.665
So you two had this planned all along.

13:19.185 --> 13:20.545
That's right.

13:20.625 --> 13:22.025
So that signal arrow just now

13:22.105 --> 13:23.705
was also part of your secret coordination?

13:24.385 --> 13:26.905
You could call it that,
and a bit of luck too.

13:29.385 --> 13:31.065
Just how many things
are you still keeping from me?

13:31.785 --> 13:34.545
Ever since I got here,
you've barely even looked at me.

13:34.625 --> 13:35.465
I didn't get the chance to say anything!

13:36.985 --> 13:39.385
With your brains, Mr. Bai,
if you really wanted to tell me,

13:39.465 --> 13:40.705
you'd have a hundred ways.

13:41.345 --> 13:43.785
I'm afraid from the very start,
you never meant to tell me at all.

13:46.425 --> 13:48.065
Good thing our ideas still line up.

13:48.145 --> 13:49.105
Guess we're a bit on the same wavelength.

13:50.705 --> 13:51.665
Who's on the same wavelength with you?

13:54.745 --> 13:55.905
Cangcang?

13:59.345 --> 14:01.425
Your Highness.
I've already turned in for the night!

14:02.705 --> 14:03.985
My brother just said

14:04.065 --> 14:05.225
Ling Jueding wants to launch
a sneak attack

14:05.305 --> 14:07.185
and told me to check on you.

14:10.545 --> 14:11.945
Cangcang!

14:12.025 --> 14:13.265
Cangcang, are you all right?

14:16.465 --> 14:18.705
You… you two…

14:19.385 --> 14:20.745
Your Highness,

14:20.825 --> 14:22.825
staring at us like that
isn't exactly proper, right?

14:25.025 --> 14:27.105
So sorry! I'll stop bothering you.

14:36.305 --> 14:37.345
Get out.

14:39.025 --> 14:40.465
Kuminjia just left.

14:40.985 --> 14:44.385
If I walk out now,
won't that prove we were faking it?

14:45.905 --> 14:46.905
If you ask me,

14:47.585 --> 14:49.665
I should stay here a little longer.

14:49.745 --> 14:52.425
Only then will people believe
our little act was real.

14:58.425 --> 15:01.585
I'm only playing along like this
because of the situation.

15:02.385 --> 15:04.065
Don't read anything into it.
Don't get the wrong idea.

15:06.905 --> 15:08.105
What are you trying to say?

15:13.625 --> 15:14.825
I'm saying

15:16.905 --> 15:18.785
since there's no going back for us,

15:20.225 --> 15:21.745
let's stop clinging to each other.

15:25.105 --> 15:26.865
I'll help you get the map out.

15:28.065 --> 15:29.465
Stay away from me after this.

15:32.425 --> 15:34.025
If you want to stay here, then stay.

15:35.425 --> 15:36.465
I'm leaving.

15:40.105 --> 15:43.105
It's cold outside. This is your tent.

15:44.265 --> 15:45.305
I should be the one to go.

16:59.825 --> 17:00.665
I'm saying

17:02.825 --> 17:04.505
since there's no going back for us,

17:06.145 --> 17:07.745
let's stop clinging to each other.

17:20.545 --> 17:21.704
Mr. Bai,

17:22.224 --> 17:23.745
why the long face?

17:24.385 --> 17:25.305
Where's Cangcang?

17:26.385 --> 17:28.464
Didn't you two rekindle your old flame?

17:35.785 --> 17:38.305
Get back together?
If only it were that easy.

17:39.105 --> 17:40.825
You were fine just yesterday.

17:40.905 --> 17:42.865
How come she doesn't like you again today?

17:44.585 --> 17:45.825
It's my fault.

17:47.025 --> 17:50.105
Cangcang once said
she wanted to visit Xijiang

17:51.305 --> 17:53.025
for the most beautiful grasslands

17:53.105 --> 17:54.585
and the most beautiful snow mountains.

17:55.905 --> 17:57.945
She wanted to ride across them with me.

17:59.425 --> 18:02.305
But I promised her
and never kept that promise.

18:03.905 --> 18:05.745
When we brought it up last night,

18:06.265 --> 18:07.545
she got mad at me.

18:08.385 --> 18:09.985
Then just go. What's so hard about that?

18:11.225 --> 18:14.105
The general ordered
that we're not allowed to leave the camp.

18:14.185 --> 18:16.065
We're in a truce right now.

18:16.145 --> 18:17.465
What's the big deal?

18:17.545 --> 18:18.865
You've got me anyway.
I'll go with you both!

18:20.905 --> 18:22.865
Cangcang still holds it against me.

18:23.385 --> 18:24.465
She won't agree.

18:26.425 --> 18:27.305
Mr. Bai,

18:27.825 --> 18:29.185
you really don't understand women at all.

18:36.145 --> 18:38.665
Cangcang, Mr. Bai and I are going hunting.

18:39.265 --> 18:40.265
Do you want to come?

18:41.025 --> 18:42.625
You're going out hunting?

18:42.705 --> 18:44.425
Yeah. Just the two of us.

18:45.785 --> 18:48.305
This is actually the perfect chance
to get the map out.

18:48.385 --> 18:49.665
Cangcang, don't you want to come with us?

18:50.305 --> 18:51.905
You ride and shoot so well.

18:52.625 --> 18:53.865
You're no less skilled
than us grassland folk.

18:55.145 --> 18:56.065
Well?

18:56.145 --> 18:57.745
My hands are itching for a match anyway.

18:57.825 --> 18:58.985
Dare to have a contest?

18:59.585 --> 19:00.825
Contest in what?

19:00.905 --> 19:01.745
Hunting, of course.

19:01.825 --> 19:03.425
Whoever wins,

19:03.505 --> 19:05.305
Mr. Bai has to wait on them tonight.

19:05.385 --> 19:06.665
How about it?

19:10.185 --> 19:11.305
Fine.

19:12.265 --> 19:13.385
Very well.

19:14.425 --> 19:17.265
Then tonight, just let him wait on you.

19:22.665 --> 19:25.105
Do you actually like him or not?

19:25.185 --> 19:26.425
Last night, I saw you two

19:27.705 --> 19:29.105
sharing the same bed.

19:32.065 --> 19:34.705
So do you really not care,
or are you jealous?

19:36.385 --> 19:37.945
Who says I'm jealous?

19:39.745 --> 19:40.585
What she means is,

19:41.425 --> 19:43.745
alive or dead, I'm hers all the same.

19:43.825 --> 19:46.145
-She'd never get jealous.
-Hey…

19:46.225 --> 19:47.425
When did I ever say that?

19:48.305 --> 19:49.625
You want her to see right through us?

19:52.585 --> 19:54.265
All right, we're just teasing you.

19:54.345 --> 19:55.505
I don't need him waiting on me anyway.

19:55.585 --> 19:56.625
Let's go!

20:17.465 --> 20:18.785
With all these soldiers tailing us,

20:19.505 --> 20:23.265
I have to shake them off
to get the map out.

20:30.785 --> 20:32.065
Your Highness,

20:32.585 --> 20:33.945
are we really just hunting like this?

20:34.785 --> 20:37.025
Why? Do you really want that contest?

20:38.065 --> 20:39.145
Of course.

20:39.225 --> 20:40.865
I need to prove myself to Cangcang.

20:42.105 --> 20:43.185
You really are persistent.

20:43.265 --> 20:44.745
Cangcang, what do you think?

20:45.705 --> 20:47.265
If we really do compete,

20:47.345 --> 20:48.745
he might not even be a match for us.

20:49.625 --> 20:50.465
All right.

20:50.545 --> 20:53.105
In that case,
let's have ourselves a contest.

20:53.625 --> 20:55.785
Mr. Bai, if you win,

20:55.865 --> 20:57.305
I'll be the witness to you two.

20:57.385 --> 20:59.665
But if your skills fall short,

20:59.745 --> 21:01.905
then from now on,
stop clinging to our heroine Cangcang.

21:02.865 --> 21:05.985
-Deal. What are the rules?
-Couldn't be simpler.

21:06.065 --> 21:07.305
Within an hour,

21:07.385 --> 21:08.905
whoever brings back more game wins.

21:08.985 --> 21:10.865
-What about the hunting range?
-Go wherever you like.

21:10.945 --> 21:12.985
But if you're not back in an hour,

21:13.065 --> 21:15.505
your catch won't count
no matter how big it is.

21:16.105 --> 21:19.065
-All right. Then let's begin!
-Start the clock!

21:42.505 --> 21:44.625
Cangcang's this nervous about the result.

21:44.705 --> 21:45.745
Looks like she's really not into you.

21:45.825 --> 21:47.345
You're doomed.

21:47.425 --> 21:49.265
Your Highness, we only just started.

21:49.345 --> 21:51.665
Don't write me off so quickly.
What if I win?

21:52.265 --> 21:53.745
All right. I'll be waiting to see.

22:35.505 --> 22:36.385
Lin Cangcang,

22:36.465 --> 22:38.985
if you lose,
I'm going to set you up with Mr. Bai.

22:39.945 --> 22:41.665
It's a bit early to be calling it now.

23:03.745 --> 23:05.225
Kumor, what are you doing here?

23:06.185 --> 23:07.345
I had some free time today.

23:07.425 --> 23:09.745
I heard you were out hunting here,
so I came to take a look.

23:10.345 --> 23:12.145
-Where's Mr. Bai?
-He…

23:13.545 --> 23:15.345
I just saw him chasing after a young deer.

23:15.425 --> 23:18.105
Guess he's really desperate to win.
The match isn't over yet, right?

23:44.745 --> 23:46.105
Your Highness, you've got five kills,

23:46.185 --> 23:47.785
and Miss Lin has five as well.

23:48.385 --> 23:49.865
Didn't expect you to be this good.

23:49.945 --> 23:51.225
Now it all depends on Mr. Bai.

23:57.745 --> 23:58.945
He still isn't back.

23:59.665 --> 24:01.305
If Kumor discovers our plan…

24:27.665 --> 24:29.705
Mr. Bai, how did you do?

24:29.785 --> 24:31.225
With an hour out there,

24:31.305 --> 24:33.785
I'm sure you brought in quite a haul.

24:35.665 --> 24:37.145
Here, take a look.

24:47.745 --> 24:49.465
With this much game,

24:50.185 --> 24:53.225
Kumor won't suspect
he had time to do anything else.

24:56.985 --> 24:58.905
Your riding and archery are impressive.

24:59.585 --> 25:01.265
You have my respect.

25:01.345 --> 25:03.345
Your Highness,
how exactly are you planning to help me?

25:04.665 --> 25:06.945
No matter how she helps, I'm not into you.

25:09.305 --> 25:10.465
I'll go talk to her for you.

25:33.105 --> 25:36.665
I didn't expect you to be a real hunter.

25:36.745 --> 25:38.065
You flatter me.

25:38.145 --> 25:41.265
I had to give it my all
just to please Cangcang.

25:42.185 --> 25:43.865
Ever heard the saying,

25:43.945 --> 25:45.265
"Forced love never turns out sweet"?

25:45.865 --> 25:47.665
Cangcang gave up on you long ago.

25:48.225 --> 25:49.865
And have you ever heard,

25:49.945 --> 25:52.305
"Sincerity can move even stone"?

25:53.625 --> 25:55.905
You really are stubborn.

25:57.385 --> 25:59.825
You're just as stubborn as I am.

26:01.065 --> 26:02.185
Mr. Bai,

26:03.625 --> 26:04.825
what do you mean by that?

26:06.945 --> 26:08.705
You refuse to pull your troops back.

26:09.225 --> 26:10.625
Isn't that stubbornness too?

26:12.385 --> 26:14.305
You're just a wandering swordsman,

26:14.385 --> 26:16.625
yet you dare lecture me on war?

26:17.425 --> 26:19.145
Aren't you afraid
I'll start doubting who you really are?

26:19.225 --> 26:20.425
All I'm saying is,

26:20.505 --> 26:22.225
you're not a man who kills for pleasure.

26:23.105 --> 26:25.105
Whether it's your soldiers
or the common folk,

26:25.185 --> 26:28.505
you value every life.

26:29.625 --> 26:31.705
But if you insist on not withdrawing,

26:32.225 --> 26:33.905
once you go to war with Great Qi,

26:34.505 --> 26:36.905
many lives will be lost.

26:39.865 --> 26:42.145
Since the status verification system
was put in place,

26:43.105 --> 26:47.585
generations of hard work
from Xijiang folks vanished overnight!

26:48.785 --> 26:50.305
Then came a year of disaster,

26:50.905 --> 26:52.465
with corpses of the starved
all over the land.

26:53.385 --> 26:54.905
You think I want to fight?

26:57.985 --> 26:59.785
If my people could just live in peace,

27:00.825 --> 27:02.185
who would choose to live by the blade?

27:04.025 --> 27:06.425
War is never the best choice.

27:07.065 --> 27:09.825
For me, the best choice

27:10.865 --> 27:12.625
is letting my people live better lives.

27:13.225 --> 27:15.665
But war will
only make more innocent people die.

27:17.145 --> 27:20.025
Have you ever considered
ending this peacefully?

27:22.065 --> 27:24.425
The weak are meat for the strong.
Only the fittest survive.

27:25.305 --> 27:26.985
Even if I were willing,

27:27.065 --> 27:28.625
would that rotten emperor agree?

27:31.865 --> 27:33.305
You won't know unless you try.

27:38.785 --> 27:39.785
Bai Chifan,

27:40.545 --> 27:42.185
you're undermining the troops' morale!

27:43.665 --> 27:44.705
I wouldn't dare.

27:45.385 --> 27:46.785
I just feel

27:47.305 --> 27:49.425
if you truly put your people first,

27:49.505 --> 27:50.745
then it's worth taking the long view.

28:23.985 --> 28:26.145
During this time,
you must not use your inner force!

28:26.905 --> 28:28.225
If the poison reaches your heart,

28:28.825 --> 28:30.865
even I may be powerless to save you.

28:41.545 --> 28:42.945
I've already lost so much time.

28:43.025 --> 28:44.145
There's barely any left to hunt.

28:44.945 --> 28:48.025
But if I come back empty-handed,
it will surely arouse suspicion.

29:32.225 --> 29:33.665
It's only late autumn
in the Central Plains,

29:34.185 --> 29:35.545
but it's already winter out here.

29:36.625 --> 29:39.785
Today's bitter cold
means a blizzard is coming.

29:43.025 --> 29:45.265
Cangcang has to leave this place
as soon as possible.

29:51.425 --> 29:52.385
Eat up!

29:54.465 --> 29:55.305
Fill it up!

29:55.385 --> 29:56.705
Guys! The meat's here!

29:56.785 --> 29:59.105
-Hurry up!
-Drink up!

30:00.145 --> 30:01.185
Have a drink!

30:01.945 --> 30:02.785
Another one!

30:05.185 --> 30:06.625
Down it!

30:07.385 --> 30:08.225
Drain it!

30:09.265 --> 30:10.665
Here! Pour it!

30:10.745 --> 30:12.345
Mr. Bai! Get over here!

30:12.425 --> 30:14.545
Deputy General Zhang got us
the best cuts of meat!

30:14.625 --> 30:15.745
Have a drink!

30:16.265 --> 30:17.305
Smells amazing!

30:19.465 --> 30:20.505
Coming!

30:21.225 --> 30:22.905
-Fill it up!
-Fill my cup!

30:22.985 --> 30:24.185
Come on, have another piece!

30:25.345 --> 30:26.985
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

30:28.065 --> 30:29.225
Minjia, sit here.

30:30.345 --> 30:32.265
-Okay.
-Come for more when you're done!

30:33.305 --> 30:34.785
This is mutton boiled in ice water.

30:34.865 --> 30:36.465
It's how we grassland folk eat it.

30:36.545 --> 30:37.585
Come and try.

30:37.665 --> 30:39.625
How come there's suddenly so much mutton?

30:39.705 --> 30:40.545
The General's supplies have arrived?

30:41.145 --> 30:42.745
Should be. No idea.

30:43.905 --> 30:45.025
Whatever, let's eat!

30:50.945 --> 30:51.985
Sir!

30:52.545 --> 30:53.465
Deputy General Zhang,

30:53.985 --> 30:54.865
I said

30:54.945 --> 30:56.625
no one was to harass the common folk!

30:57.545 --> 30:58.545
Why did you disobey my orders?

30:59.825 --> 31:00.665
Spare us, Sir!

31:01.585 --> 31:02.585
Sir,

31:02.665 --> 31:04.705
Deputy General Zhang really had no choice.

31:04.785 --> 31:06.105
Our supplies are almost gone.

31:06.185 --> 31:08.025
The soldiers have been living
on plain rice porridge for days.

31:08.705 --> 31:10.385
If this keeps up,
before we even reach the walls,

31:10.465 --> 31:12.105
our morale will be crushed!

31:22.465 --> 31:23.705
Deputy General Zhang has defied orders.

31:24.345 --> 31:25.625
Twenty lashes!

31:26.225 --> 31:27.705
Let that be a warning!

31:28.585 --> 31:29.465
Yes, Sir.

31:41.105 --> 31:41.985
Men, hear my order!

31:43.585 --> 31:45.185
The meat you're boiling right now

31:45.985 --> 31:47.625
was all seized from the villagers!

31:48.825 --> 31:49.785
Whatever you've eaten,

31:50.425 --> 31:51.825
you'll pay back in full!

31:52.345 --> 31:55.545
The rest goes back exactly as it is!

31:56.305 --> 31:58.265
Supplies are already on the way.

31:59.305 --> 32:00.425
Starting tomorrow,

32:00.945 --> 32:04.025
I'll send a small unit out
to hunt every day.

32:04.625 --> 32:06.025
I give you my word:

32:06.545 --> 32:07.865
I won't let any of you starve!

32:08.985 --> 32:10.465
But from this day on,

32:11.065 --> 32:12.985
if anyone dares bother the people again,

32:14.065 --> 32:15.945
-I will not let it slide!
-Yes, Sir!

32:59.425 --> 33:00.545
You want my poison powder?

33:02.345 --> 33:03.505
Ying,

33:03.585 --> 33:05.305
is there any way

33:05.385 --> 33:07.825
to make some poison or powder

33:09.065 --> 33:11.985
that will infect the locusts
but leave the flowers unharmed?

33:12.665 --> 33:15.025
And the poison has to spread fast.

33:16.665 --> 33:17.905
Spread to the Emperor?

33:20.145 --> 33:22.065
No, spread to other bugs.

33:25.345 --> 33:28.505
So you want a poison or powder

33:29.025 --> 33:31.985
that kills the insects
but not the flowers…

33:32.905 --> 33:34.585
-is that it?
-Exactly!

33:35.225 --> 33:36.465
You're really clever.

33:38.225 --> 33:39.265
No.

33:40.865 --> 33:42.345
I don't have anything like that.

33:45.025 --> 33:46.065
It's fine.

33:46.145 --> 33:47.705
I was just asking.

33:50.745 --> 33:52.705
But I can try to mix something.

33:58.025 --> 33:59.065
But Qianqing,

33:59.585 --> 34:01.505
you have to promise me one thing.

34:04.505 --> 34:05.825
Let's hear it first.

34:07.185 --> 34:08.225
Relax.

34:08.744 --> 34:09.585
This time,

34:10.744 --> 34:12.344
I'm not after the Emperor's life.

34:35.264 --> 34:36.304
Your Highness.

34:37.344 --> 34:39.105
His Highness asked me to help you

34:39.185 --> 34:40.425
with an experiment
that will benefit the realm.

34:52.025 --> 34:52.905
Let's begin.

35:16.305 --> 35:17.385
At this time of year,

35:18.905 --> 35:19.865
how are there still fireflies?

35:44.065 --> 35:47.385
All these bugs
are dusted with my glowing powder.

35:49.625 --> 35:50.865
Pretty, aren't they?

35:51.665 --> 35:52.505
They are.

36:05.745 --> 36:06.585
Do you like them?

36:21.425 --> 36:22.865
Let's stay here and watch,

36:24.025 --> 36:25.665
see how long it takes

36:26.265 --> 36:27.785
before they all…

36:27.865 --> 36:28.945
one by one…

36:29.465 --> 36:30.545
one by one…

36:32.585 --> 36:34.105
die out!

37:29.425 --> 37:31.145
The three days are up.

37:31.225 --> 37:33.105
Your Highness,
please give the order at once

37:33.185 --> 37:34.505
to release grain to Jiangzhou.

37:34.585 --> 37:38.425
You truly live for the country.

37:38.505 --> 37:41.385
You worry day and night over Jiangzhou.

37:41.465 --> 37:43.625
Aren't you afraid
you'll work yourself sick?

37:44.225 --> 37:47.465
Easing Great Qi's troubles
is simply my duty.

37:48.425 --> 37:50.505
As a subject of the realm,

37:50.585 --> 37:52.665
I trust Your Highness feels the same.

37:55.305 --> 37:56.425
Of course.

37:57.505 --> 38:00.985
What did that memorial from Xuzhou
say again?

38:03.865 --> 38:05.385
Ah yes, I remember.

38:06.145 --> 38:07.545
It claimed the Governor of Xuzhou

38:07.625 --> 38:09.905
had the disaster under control

38:10.705 --> 38:12.185
and all was well.

38:12.265 --> 38:14.105
Yet the reports I received say

38:14.185 --> 38:18.065
the Xuzhou officials
neglected their duties

38:18.585 --> 38:20.465
and the disaster is long out of hand!

38:22.865 --> 38:26.025
If Your Highness has doubts,

38:26.105 --> 38:28.225
you can send people to investigate.

38:30.065 --> 38:32.185
But the army grain for Jiangzhou
keeps being delayed.

38:32.265 --> 38:35.425
If you ignore the lives
of the border troops,

38:35.505 --> 38:37.865
I'm afraid you cannot shrug off the blame.

38:38.905 --> 38:40.785
So what you mean is

38:40.865 --> 38:43.665
that we must settle the matter

38:43.745 --> 38:44.985
of Jiangzhou's grain today?

38:47.185 --> 38:48.225
We must.

38:48.305 --> 38:49.425
Very well!

38:50.585 --> 38:51.785
Bring ink and brush.

39:12.545 --> 39:13.665
Eunuch Feng,

39:14.185 --> 39:15.265
what's today's date?

39:15.345 --> 39:17.465
Your Highness, it is Year Nine of Yongxi…

39:17.545 --> 39:18.585
All right.

39:19.345 --> 39:20.385
I remember now.

39:27.785 --> 39:30.465
Zhong Lin, if you don't get back soon,

39:31.105 --> 39:33.345
I'll lose this whole game.

39:34.145 --> 39:35.985
Urgent dispatch from Xuzhou!

39:45.545 --> 39:46.865
MEMORIAL FROM THE GOVERNOR OF XUZHOU

39:59.385 --> 40:01.585
LOCUST PLAGUE HAS LEFT THE PEOPLE
STARVING AND DISPLACED

40:03.825 --> 40:06.265
Mr. Song, you must be weary from the road.
Please, rise.

40:07.345 --> 40:08.185
Thank you.

40:08.265 --> 40:09.945
Your Highness,

40:10.025 --> 40:12.385
the locust plague in Xuzhou is severe.

40:12.465 --> 40:13.825
The prefecture office was slow to respond,

40:14.545 --> 40:17.185
leaving the people without grain
and refugees on the move.

40:17.265 --> 40:19.865
Neighboring prefectures have
already been affected.

40:19.945 --> 40:22.025
Soon, this tide of refugees

40:22.105 --> 40:23.305
may even reach the capital.

40:26.345 --> 40:27.465
How dare he!

40:27.545 --> 40:29.865
-Indeed.
-That's deceiving the throne!

40:31.225 --> 40:32.385
Just as I thought.

40:32.985 --> 40:36.385
The Governor of Xuzhou is bold indeed

40:36.465 --> 40:37.985
to lie in a report to the throne!

40:39.265 --> 40:41.945
Someone took the chance

40:42.025 --> 40:43.265
to collude with the Governor

40:44.025 --> 40:45.185
to seal the city off for a time.

40:45.265 --> 40:46.545
No one was allowed in or out,

40:47.145 --> 40:50.585
hoping to grind Xuzhou down
into a dead city!

40:51.985 --> 40:53.905
I have fulfilled my duty

40:54.705 --> 40:57.025
and brought back
the Governor's letter of confession.

41:03.705 --> 41:05.505
MEMORIAL FROM THE GOVERNOR OF XUZHOU

41:05.585 --> 41:06.705
The proof is here.

41:08.305 --> 41:11.465
Grand Tutor Ling,
do you have a plan to deal with this?

41:30.505 --> 41:33.025
That brat Xiao Qianqing
went behind my back,

41:33.865 --> 41:35.985
and turned the tables on me in court.

41:38.225 --> 41:41.145
He only did this to force my hand

41:42.305 --> 41:43.665
into raising grain for him.

41:45.585 --> 41:46.545
My Lord,

41:47.265 --> 41:49.665
sacrificing the Governor of Xuzhou
as a pawn

41:49.745 --> 41:51.305
won't really hurt our foundations.

41:51.945 --> 41:54.225
It's just that
the army grain for Jiangzhou…

41:54.305 --> 41:56.545
It really can't be delayed any longer.

41:57.705 --> 41:59.265
And the grain merchants?

41:59.345 --> 42:01.505
None of them
can raise grain on short notice?

42:02.025 --> 42:03.065
No, Sir.

42:03.665 --> 42:04.825
Which one

42:06.505 --> 42:08.305
complained the loudest about his troubles?

42:08.385 --> 42:10.545
Wan of Wan's Rice Shop.

42:10.625 --> 42:11.505
He claims he's taken a huge loss.

42:13.265 --> 42:14.625
I see.

42:15.505 --> 42:16.345
Fine.

42:16.425 --> 42:18.785
You'll pay him a visit yourself

42:20.825 --> 42:22.465
and bring Mr. Wan…

42:23.665 --> 42:25.825
a little "comfort".

42:27.465 --> 42:28.385
Yes, My Lord.

42:46.425 --> 42:47.865
WAN'S WINERY

42:49.585 --> 42:50.745
WAN'S RICE SHOP

43:13.665 --> 43:14.665
Your Highness,

43:14.745 --> 43:16.825
Grand Tutor Ling
has secured grain this morning.

43:16.905 --> 43:18.545
Together with the surplus
in the national granary,

43:18.625 --> 43:20.905
it's enough to cover Jiangzhou
and Xuzhou's needs.

43:23.025 --> 43:25.425
Forcing him to show his hand…

43:25.945 --> 43:28.305
all my scheming was worth it.

43:29.665 --> 43:32.185
By the way, any news from Jiangzhou?
